 ## Background
-VM decomposition was proposed in the context of Tensorial Radiance Fields (TensoRF) by Chen et al. in 2022 [S1][S2, S3, unofficial]. It is inspired by CP decomposition and Block Term Decomposition (BTD) [S2, S3, unofficial]. The method was introduced to address the high computational costs of radiance field reconstruction by providing a more efficient tensor factorization than CP, allowing for faster training and rendering while maintaining high quality [S1][S3, unofficial].
